<title>FRANCE: French minister to Russia and neighbours.</title>
<headline>French minister to Russia and neighbours.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Foreign Minister Herve de Charette will discuss the Middle East, European security, ex-Yugoslavia and the situation in the Caucasus when he visits Russia, Armenia, Georgia and Azerbaijan next week, his office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>De Charette will be in Russia on October 8, in Armenia on October 9, in Georgia on October 10 and in Azerbaijan on October 11, his office said. No details were immediately available.</p>
